{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NINDO Guardian of the Starlit Shadow\u00a0</strong>is a ninja-themed roguelike deckbuilding game set in a beautifully stylized Japanese world. <br>Face powerful enemies, grow through choices, and craft your own unique path of strategy and strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/44c145b3e986c3fc2f7219c162f9df11.poster.avif?t=1757509703\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/44c145b3e986c3fc2f7219c162f9df11.webm?t=1757509703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/44c145b3e986c3fc2f7219c162f9df11.mp4?t=1757509703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <strong>Striking Visuals: Anime Meets Traditional Japan</strong><br>Explore a vivid world where classic Japanese aesthetics blend with colorful anime-style visuals. Unique characters and enemies bring this world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Deckbuilding with Tactical Depth</strong><br>Choose new cards after each battle to strengthen your deck. Use ninjutsu, martial arts, and ultimate techniques to outsmart your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong><br>Each dungeon run offers new encounters and events. Learn from defeat, grow stronger, and dive back into the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Storytelling through Flavor Text</strong><br>Discover the pasts and fates of the ninja through the rich flavor text on cards and items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Flow</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse procedurally generated maps filled with battles and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards strategically to defeat your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your deck with new cards, items, and gear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own <strong>NINDO</strong> \u2014 the way of the ninja.<br>\ud83c\udfae Play the free demo now and get a taste of what's to come!<br>\ud83d\uded2 Add to your wishlist so you won't miss the official release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/739717bd95802dd5382514ab2216683c.poster.avif?t=1757509703\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/739717bd95802dd5382514ab2216683c.webm?t=1757509703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/739717bd95802dd5382514ab2216683c.mp4?t=1757509703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supported Languages</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese (Full Support)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English (Translated)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese (Simplified &amp; Traditional)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 Currently in development for Early Access<br>\ud83d\udd04 Regular updates planned with new cards and features<br>\ud83e\udd1d Community feedback is welcome \u2014 help shape the future of NINDO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/e504729383fc385187693f25ee22a43d.avif?t=1757509703\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>","background