es bring this world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Deckbuilding with Tactical Depth</strong><br>Choose new cards after each battle to strengthen your deck. Use ninjutsu, martial arts, and ultimate techniques to outsmart your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong><br>Each dungeon run offers new encounters and events. Learn from defeat, grow stronger, and dive back into the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Storytelling through Flavor Text</strong><br>Discover the pasts and fates of the ninja through the rich flavor text on cards and items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Flow</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse procedurally generated maps filled with battles and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards strategically to defeat your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your deck with new cards, items, and gear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own <strong>NINDO</strong> \u2014 the way of the ninja.<br>\ud83c\udfae Play the free demo now and get a taste of what's to come!<br>\ud83d\uded2 Add to your wishlist so you won't miss the official release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/739717bd95802dd5382514ab2216683c.poster.avif?t=1757509703\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/739717bd95802dd5382514ab2216683c.webm?t=1757509703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/739717bd95802dd5382514ab2216683c.mp4?t=1757509703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supported Languages</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese (Full Support)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English (Translated)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese (Simplified &amp; Traditional)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 Currently in development for Early Access<br>\ud83d\udd04 Regular updates planned with new cards and features<br>\ud83e\udd1d Community feedback is welcome \u2014 help shape the future of NINDO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/e504729383fc385187693f25ee22a43d.avif?t=1757509703\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>","developers":["MORIKICHIDO"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/850bb1981657dcc1d9f4469883cb13fd96d38a4f/header.jpg?t=1757509703","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257189794,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189794/movie480.mp4?t=1756348122","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189794/movie_max.mp4?t=1756348122"},"name":"Ver25.09-2 TeaserMovie","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189794/4156eaaab9ad8808a62cf990ce40af043589bcae/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756348122","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189794/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756348122","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189794/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756348122"}}],"name":"NINDO Guardian of the Starlit Shadow","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel C